    "zh": "名字和特征",
    "en": "Name and features",
    "ms": "Nama dan ciri"
   },
   "level": "basic",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": {
      "zh": "{{t:orthoptera}}来自希腊文 orthos（直）加 pteron（翅），意思是「直的翅」：前翅窄长而直。",
      "en": "{{t:orthoptera}} comes from the Greek orthos (straight) and pteron (wing): 'straight-winged', after the long narrow forewings.",
      "ms": "{{t:orthoptera}} berasal daripada bahasa Yunani orthos (lurus) dan pteron (sayap): 'bersayap lurus', merujuk sayap depan yang panjang dan sempit."
     },
     "defines": [
      "orthoptera"
     ],
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "gallery",
     "ids": [
      "katydid-dicranopsyra",
      "leaf-grasshopper-chorotypus",
      "grasshopper-tauchira"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "kind": "key",
     "text": {
      "zh": "「直」：窄长的直翅，加上会跳的后腿。",
      "en": "Think 'straight': long straight wings and jumping hind legs.",
      "ms": "Ingat 'lurus': sayap lurus panjang dan kaki belakang pelompat."
     },
     "src": [
      "LSJ"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "list",
     "items": [
      {
       "zh": "后足是粗大的跳跃足",
       "en": "Hind legs are big jumping legs",
       "ms": "Kaki belakang ialah kaki melompat yang besar"
      },
      {
       "zh": "前翅像皮革（覆翅）",
       "en": "Leathery forewings (tegmina)",
       "ms": "Sayap depan seperti kulit (tegmina)"
      },
      {
       "zh": "很多种类会摩擦身体发声",
       "en": "Many make sounds by rubbing body parts together",
       "ms": "Banyak menghasilkan bunyi dengan menggesel bahagian badan"
      }
     ],
     "src": [
      "WTK:5",
      "TJ:40",
      "PURDUE-TA",
      "TJ:30"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
